<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOUTH AFRICA, JAPAN TO SIGN TAX TREATY.</title>
<headline>SOUTH AFRICA, JAPAN TO SIGN TAX TREATY.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa and Japan are to sign a convention on double taxation on Friday, a finance ministry statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the treaty would be signed in Cape Town by Deputy Finance Minister Gill Marcus and Japanese ambassador Yoshizo Konishi.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +2721 403-2502</p>
</text>
